lesson_24_kinetic_monte_carlo::sec_kmc_m.faded_worked_step_markdown:
**Step 1 (Given):** Vineyard's HTST prefactor is the ratio of $3N$ basin normal-mode frequencies to the $3N-1$ stable saddle-point frequencies perpendicular to the unstable reaction coordinate: $
u_0 =  rac{\prod_{n=1}^{3N} 
u_n^{	ext{min}}}{\prod_{n=1}^{3N-1} 
u_n^{	ext{sad}}} \sim 10^{12}	ext{--}10^{13}	ext{ Hz}$. **Step 2 (Intermediate):** Mean waiting time for a single escape channel of rate $k = 
u_0 e^{-E_a / k_B T}$ is $	au = 1 / k$. **Step 3 (Complete):** Verify unit consistency: $k_B = 8.6173 	imes 10^{-5}	ext{ eV/K}$ gives $k_B T \approx 0.02585	ext{ eV}$ at $T = 300	ext{ K}$.

